  "ruleText": "Liq 1001.02 Distribution. No samples of tobacco products, e-cigarettes or liquid nicotine shall be distributed in any manner other than directly from a sampler to a consumer of legal age.\n\nSource. #6668, eff 1-1-98, EXPIRED: 1-1-06\n\nNew. #12082, eff 1-6-17",
